"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.6,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: 'catches Exception, not just DDGSException, so nothing escapes to the gate - a raw httpx/connection error is caught on the same path'","AC3 tests only httpx.ConnectError, not a programmer-error class, so the masking is untested","A DDGS subclass delegating to a wrapped client can itself raise AttributeError/TypeError on a shape mismatch, which would be indistinguishable from a network fault under `except Exception`"],"finding":"Branch 2 catches bare Exception, so an internal programming error in the boundary or in DuckDuckGoSearchTool.__call__ (e.g. TypeError/AttributeError) is silently converted into the DEGRADED-BUT-COMPLETE sentinel rather than surfacing, masking a real defect as 'web unavailable'.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"feaf4823fdc2107a9","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach (decided), branch 2; AC3","norm_id":"n0591cdd043012c9c","priority":0.0,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A future pydantic-ai/ddgs signature change makes the delegated text() call raise TypeError; the boundary reports WEB_SEARCH_UNAVAILABLE instead of failing loudly, so the mis-integration is never noticed"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.625,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","in